From e9f81b85281d578c83d50e271c33625f2b8fa51f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jul 2024 20:51:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add legacy mode for Script execution without BCH upgrades
 (#19)

Dogecoin doesn't have a lot of the script features that BCH/XEC added. Instead of removing them (and having to refactor a lot of code), we add a script flag SCRIPT_VERIFY_LEGACY_RULES, which runs the interpreter in legacy mode:

- Disable OP_CAT, OP_SPLIT, OP_AND, OP_OR, OP_XOR, OP_DIV, OP_MOD, OP_NUM2BIN, OP_BIN2NUM.
- Remove OP_REVERSEBYTES.
- Remove OP_CHECKDATASIG and OP_CHECKDATASIGVERIFY.
- Disable Schnorr signatures.

